 "remarks": "Impeccably maintained 1,800 sq ft 3BR condo in desirable West Norwalk - a spacious house alternative with a great floor plan. Expansive living room featuring wood burning fireplace and outdoor deck access, dining room, updated chef's kitchen with sleek stainless steel appliances, including premium Wolf electric cooktop, double ovens and ample cabinets. Primary suite featuring, updated bathroom and an abundance of closet space. Two additional generously sized bedrooms and hall bath offer plenty of room for family, guests, or home office and more oversized closets and storage. New in-unit washer and dryer, 1-car parking space in garage under the unit with added storage and ample outdoor parking. Set within the beautifully maintained Ledgebrook community amenities include pool, exercise room, guest parking, walking trails surrounded by mature trees and a pretty pond. Ideally located near Norwalk's Rt 1 shopping, SONO restaurants, and train stations. 60 minutes to NYC. Move-in ready. Credit check required, 2 months security, no pets, no smoking. Year lease, unfurnished.",
